/* The pop-up menu, tracked open at x, y by window_active with its second item highlighted. w and h only reserve space: the measured window and item rectangles are in the report. */
CELL(3, menu, K_MENU, 8, 292, 200, 180, 0, 0, 0, "")

/* ======================================================================================================================
 * Sheets 4 and up belong to refscene (../refscene/refscene.c): whole windows and live controls, driven and read back
 * over the serial port. refgrid ignores them. x y w h are screen pixels as above; for a window the system sizes or
 * places itself (a message box, a common dialog, a dialog made from a template) they only reserve space, and the
 * measured rectangles are in the scene's dump. A list of items is written in the text argument, separated by "|".
 * ====================================================================================================================== */

