/* ---- Dialog templates, in dialog units (8-point MS Sans Serif: 4 by 8 units = 6 by 13 pixels on this system). ----
 * The layout follows the 1995 guidelines' numbers: 7 units of margin, 4 between related controls, 7 between groups,
 * buttons 50 by 14, text boxes 14 high, check boxes and option buttons 10 high, labels 8 high and 3 below the top of
 * the text box they name. Rows are in Tab order. WS_CHILD and WS_VISIBLE are added by the program. */
